<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Dexia CC offer price 3,825 Bfr/shr.</title>
<headline>Belgian Dexia CC offer price 3,825 Bfr/shr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Dexia CC said on Thursday a secondary offering of 4,948,457 shares by controlling shareholder CC/GK Holding had been priced at 3,825 francs a share, Wednesday's closing market price.</p>
<p>The three times oversubscribed offer closed early last week. The new shares are due to begin trade on the Brussels Stock Exchange later today.</p>
<p>Dexia CC is the partner bank of France's Credit Local de France. The two took cross holdings in eachothers' capital last year.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
